# Project guide

Before changing this repo, read `PRD.md`, `architecture.md`, `rules.md`, `design.md`, `tasks.md`, and `memory.md`.

Do one open item from `tasks.md` at a time. Follow `rules.md` and `design.md`. After a decision or a bugfix, add a short note to `memory.md`.
